TheTemporal PlainTimeobject is a time object with no date.

It represents an ISO 8601wall-clock timewithout a date or time zone.

Example:14:30:00.

You can create a PlainTime from a string.

You can also create a PlainTime using numeric values.

You can get the current local time usingTemporal.Now.plainTimeISO().

You can read the different parts of a PlainTime value.

Useadd()andsubtract()to do PlainTime math.

PlainTime is immutable, so the original value is not changed.

